      },
      {
        "target" : "An uncaught exception was raised. Choose \"Continue\" to continue running in an inconsistent state. Choose \"Crash\" to halt the application and file a bug with Crash Reporter. Choosing \"Crash\" will result in the loss of all unsaved data.",
        "filename" : "NSExceptionAlert.loctable",
